# Never bake secrets into the image. Without this, `COPY . .` embeds the local
# .env (SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, HF_TOKEN,
# NCBI_API_KEY) into the image, where anyone who can pull or run it can read them.
#
# The Hugging Face Space does not need these files: its real credentials come from
# Space secrets, and only .env.example is synced into the public repo. Keep the
# examples so the image still documents the expected variable names.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# VCS and Python caches
.git/
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
